    {
      "id": "claim_c717778f53f84125a35c91b2e887ae97",
      "statement": "The extension reports the repositories the root module declared, distributions and installs alike, through module_ctx.extension_metadata, split into regular and development-only lists, so Bazel can check the root module's use_repo call and bazel mod tidy can write it.",
